  "instructions": [
    "heat oil in a large tagine pot over medium-high heat.",
    "add diced kfc fried chicken and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "add sliced red onion and cook until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "add sliced yellowtail fish and cook until opaque, about 2 minutes.",
    "add chopped serrano peppers, minced garlic, and smoked aji amarillo pepper, cook for 1 minute.",
    "stir in freshly squeezed lemon juice, flaky sea salt, and black pepper.",
    "add chopped fresh figs and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "stir in peruvian aji amarillo sauce and cook until heated through.",
    "garnish with chopped cilantro and serve immediately.",
    "serve with crusty bread or over rice, if desired.",
    "adjust seasoning as needed.",
